est**:\n   - Store a test memory/fact through the chatbot.\n   - Trigger a retrieval prompt and verify that the exact recalled fact is surfaced in the response.\n\n---\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Testing and syncing the memory loop may initialize or migrate Qdrant collections and Cozo relations.\n> \n> Please confirm: should I start by verifying the live Qdrant and Cozo health and inspecting the collection schema?","thinking":"Focus is now on end-to-end vectorization, integrating the memory loop with the vector database. The goal is to establish a working system encompassing the complete pipeline. Confirmation is needed before making any potentially destructive changes.\n\n\n"}
